WEBVTT

00:01:56.031 --> 00:02:00.335
is when I watch the TV show,
Bob Ross’s “Joy of Painting.”

00:02:00.335 --> 00:02:03.438
(Laughter and applause)

00:02:03.705 --> 00:02:05.524
I would come home from school,

00:02:05.524 --> 00:02:07.059
throw some pillows on the floor,

00:02:07.059 --> 00:02:08.060
lie down

00:02:08.060 --> 00:02:10.595
and let that soft voice
just sweep over me.

00:02:11.980 --> 00:02:14.449
And he had the nicest personality.

00:02:14.966 --> 00:02:16.702
He’d turn to the camera,

00:02:16.702 --> 00:02:17.753
he’d look right at me,

00:02:17.753 --> 00:02:21.556
and he’d say the kindest things
like,  “There are no mistakes,

00:02:21.556 --> 00:02:23.008
just happy accidents.”

00:02:23.008 --> 00:02:24.009
(Laughter)

00:02:24.009 --> 00:02:26.061
And then he’d turn back to his canvas

00:02:26.061 --> 00:02:29.264
and he’d make these gentle,
relaxing sounds with his paintbrush.

00:02:29.898 --> 00:02:31.466
Tap, tap ...